<title>USA: Pulaski Cty Detention, Ky. won by JJB Hilliard.</title>
<headline>Pulaski Cty Detention, Ky. won by JJB Hilliard.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.J.B Hilliard, W.L. Lyons, Inc. said it won $1.425 million of Pulaski Cty Detention Center Corporation, Ky., first mortgage refunding revenue bonds, Series of 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.02 percent.</p>
